 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "57e5a4ba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Taller Estructura de datos\n",
    "\n",
    "### Resuelve las siguientes preguntas empleando lo aprendido con las estructuras de Datos"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "092831f1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Pon el c√É¬≥digo debajo de cada pregunta. A√É¬±ade tantas celdas de c√É¬≥digo como necesites."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "94b6abb8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 1.- Escribe una ecuaci√É¬≥n que emplee multiplicaci√É¬≥n, divisi√É¬≥n, un exponente, suma y resta y que sea igual a 427,85."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4e5e660a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95ec00dc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2.- √Ç¬øQu√É¬© har√É¬≠as para obtener la ra√É¬≠z cuadrada de 100? Busca dos formas."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d1476ef0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95232620",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 3.- √Ç¬øY el cuadrado de 100?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "14249667",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7fc5bfae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 4.- Tenemos la string 'hello'.\n",
    "#### Primero devuelve la letra 'e'\n",
    "#### Luego dale la vuelta a la string \n",
    "#### Despu√É¬©s usa dos m√É¬©todos para devolver la letra 'o'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "a6d0eb90",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "s = 'hello'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "a3f33800",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0febc918",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 5.- Crear una lista que contenga esto [0,0,0] de dos formas distintas."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "30981b24",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "80e1a951",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 6.- Reasigna 'hello' en la lista a continuaci√É¬≥n para que diga 'goodbye'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "20d1ebdf",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "lista = [1,2,[3,4,'hello']]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "e9eb03ae",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "77e38490",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 7.- Ordena la siguiente lista."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "bc957d55",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "listaSinOrdenar = [5,3,4,6,1]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "e2c2fb65",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0cc790ac",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 8.- En los siguientes diccionarios, extrae el valor de 'hello'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c390a0bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "f = {'k1':{'k2':'hello'}}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4cdcd16e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c0244e1f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "d = {'key1':'hello'}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "196ef04c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "344d780b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "g = {'k1':[{'o1':['valor escondido',['hello']]}]}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "e965a858",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
