   "id": "7692eea8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 9.- Crea una tupla."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "23886da1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6231d723",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 10.- Emplea los sets para encontrar los valores √É¬∫nicos de esta lista."
